+  <owner>madhavpruthi@google.com</owner>
+  <owner>ckitagawa@chromium.org</owner>
+  <owner>chrome-mobile-search@google.com</owner>
+  <summary>
+    Records why an attempt to attach a tab to Fusebox
+    ({FuseboxTabAttachmentSource}) was rejected before capture or upload
+    started. Each rejected tab records once, so a multi-tab picker selection may
+    record several samples.
+
+    Session unavailable: the Composebox session was not initialized. Attachment
+    limit reached: no attachment slots were left. Fresh content required, tab
+    not live: the tab needed freshly extracted content (e.g. Incognito) but its
+    renderer was not live (e.g. frozen or discarded). Cache unavailable, tab not
+    live: a background tab had neither cached page content nor a live renderer.
+    Upload rejected by native: the native controller did not accept the upload.
+
+    Not recorded for successful starts, retries after an asynchronous failure,
+    tabs that are already attached or were closed, or non-tab attachments.
+    Suggested tabs are attached automatically and only while slots remain, so
+    .SuggestedTab never records Attachment limit reached, and a rejected
+    suggestion may record again on the next suggestion update.
+  </summary>
+  <token key="FuseboxTabAttachmentSource"
+      variants="FuseboxTabAttachmentSource"/>
+</histogram>
